     2966           DISPLAY stream  PrnLibStream with frame Doc.       DOWN 1 stream PrnLibStream with frame Doc.
     2967     if use-column[1]
     2968     then  C-for-doc-code:screen-value = string(string(accum-count), entry(1, c-for-doc-code:private-data, chr(4))).
     2969     if use-column[2]
